    "summary": "Use it in your [Charge phase](vsdata:core-rule/charge-phase) on 1 **ACOLYTE HYBRIDS**, **HYBRID METAMORPHS** or **NEOPHYTE HYBRIDS** unit of yours that is yet to declare a charge this phase. An **[advance](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move)** or **[fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back)** it made this turn does not stop it from counting as **eligible to declare a charge**.\n\nWhen it **declares a charge**, this Stratagem's second part may also be used. If you use it:\n\n- it can re-roll its **[charge rolls](vsdata:core-rule/charge-step)**\n- it must finish that **charge move** **[engaged](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range)** with 1 of the enemy units that a friendly **CHARACTER** unit is engaged with",
